# Build context for images built from the repository root
# (services/*/Dockerfile, quickstart/migrate/Dockerfile).
#
# Keeps local-only files out of the context: virtualenvs and node_modules make
# the context gigabytes on a developer machine, and .env files hold that
# developer's secrets, which must never be copied into an image.

.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.next
logs
arch-docs
dev.secrets
# Locally generated JWT signing keys. auth-service creates its own at startup.
**/*.pem
